---
import LegalLayout from "../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { info } from "../../data/info";

const lastUpdatedDate = "October 21, 2026";

const pageTitle = "Terms of Service";
const metaDescription = `View the Terms of Service for ${info.name}. Review the conditions for using our free daily puzzles.`;

const h2 = "mb-4 font-display text-2xl font-bold text-ink";
const body = "text-ink/80";
const note = "rounded-md border border-accent/25 bg-accent/5 p-3";
const link = "text-accent hover:underline";
---

<LegalLayout title={pageTitle} description={metaDescription} lastUpdated={lastUpdatedDate}>
  <div>
    <p class={`${body} leading-relaxed`}>
      These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of the {info.name} website (the
      "Site"). By accessing or using the Site, you agree to these Terms.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>1) Who We Are</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      {info.name} ("we," "us," or "our") offers free daily puzzles that anyone can play in a web
      browser, with no account required.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>2) Eligibility</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      The Site is intended for users age 13 and older. By using the Site, you represent that you are at
      least 13 years old.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>3) Permitted Use</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      You may use the Site for your own personal, non-commercial enjoyment, for lawful purposes and in
      accordance with these Terms. You agree not to misuse the Site, interfere with its operation, probe
      or scan for vulnerabilities, attempt to access non-public areas or systems, or use automated means
      to access the Site, copy its puzzles, or degrade its performance.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>4) Contacting Us</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      If you contact us, you agree that the information you provide is accurate and that you have the
      right to provide it. You also agree not to send unlawful, infringing, or harmful content.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>5) No User-Generated Content</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      The Site does not allow public posting or user-generated content (such as comments, reviews, or
      uploads). Content on the Site is provided and maintained by {info.name}.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>6) Free Service and Optional Support</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      The puzzles are free to play. Support through external services such as Buy Me a Coffee is
      entirely optional, is a voluntary contribution rather than a purchase, and does not unlock any
      features or create any obligation for us to provide a service. Contributions are handled by that
      service under its own terms.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>7) Intellectual Property (Site Content)</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      The Site and its content (including the puzzles, text, graphics, icons, logos, and design) are
      owned by {info.name} or our licensors and are protected by applicable intellectual property laws.
      You may not copy, reproduce, modify, distribute, or create derivative works from the Site or its
      puzzles without our prior written permission, except as permitted by law. Sharing your own results
      or a link to the Site is always welcome.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>8) Third-Party Services and Links</h2>
    <p class={`${body} mb-3`}>
      The Site uses or links to third-party services (for example, Cloudflare for hosting, Google Fonts
      for fonts, and Buy Me a Coffee for optional support). Third-party services are governed by their
      own terms and policies, and we are not responsible for third-party content, practices, or
      availability.
    </p>
    <div class={note}>
      <p class="text-sm text-ink/80">
        <span class="font-semibold">Note:</span> We use Cloudflare for website hosting. Its terms can be
        found at
        <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/terms/" class={link} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">cloudflare.com/terms</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>9) Disclaimers</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      The Site is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. We do not warrant that the Site will
      be uninterrupted, error-free, or secure, or that any puzzle or content is accurate or complete.
      Your use of the Site is at your own risk.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>10) Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      To the maximum extent permitted by law, {info.name} will not be liable for any indirect,
      incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or any loss of data (including puzzle
      progress), arising out of or related to your use of (or inability to use) the Site.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>11) Indemnification</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      You agree to indemnify and hold harmless {info.name} from and against claims, liabilities,
      damages, losses, and expenses (including reasonable attorneys' fees) arising from your misuse of
      the Site or violation of these Terms.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>12) Termination / Restriction of Access</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      We may suspend or restrict your access to the Site (including blocking access from certain IP
      addresses) if we reasonably believe you are violating these Terms, attempting to harm the Site or
      other users, or using the Site in an unlawful manner. This section does not limit any other rights
      or remedies we may have.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>13) Availability and Saved Progress</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      We aim to keep the Site available, but we do not guarantee uninterrupted access. The Site may be
      temporarily unavailable due to maintenance, updates, hosting outages, or circumstances outside our
      control. Puzzles may change or be removed at any time. Your progress is saved only in your
      browser, so it can be lost if you clear your browser data or switch devices.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>14) Changes to the Site or Terms</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      We may modify the Site or these Terms at any time. Updated Terms will be posted on this page with a
      new "Last Updated" date. Continued use of the Site after changes become effective means you accept
      the updated Terms.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class={h2}>15) Governing Law</h2>
    <p class={body}>
      These Terms are governed by and construed in accordance with applicable laws, without regard to
      conflict-of-laws principles.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
